>> q := Daim-teev ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
{ q ? ['1']. } txhom: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught!'], kab-tshiab. }, pib.
{ q ? Tseeb. } txhom: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught!'], kab-tshiab. }, pib.
{ q ? Cuav. } txhom: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught!'], kab-tshiab. }, pib.
{ q ? Tsis-muaj-dabtsi. } txhom: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught!'], kab-tshiab. }, pib.
{ q ? (Daim-teev tshiab). } txhom: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught!'], kab-tshiab. }, pib.
{ q ? (Yam-khoom tshiab). } txhom: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught!'], kab-tshiab. }, pib.
{ q ? ({ ['Empty']. }). } txhom: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught!'], kab-tshiab. }, pib.
Tawm sau-ntawv: ['caught them all'], kab-tshiab.
